 support however because of the move to OpenTelemetry there are API changes that breaks TrackEvent which previously logged metrics and logs to now a separate method for each. Additionally metric names have new restrictions where all existing metrics in ConsoleTestHost, TestHostBuilder, and TestHostControllersTestHost do not adhere to the requirements. https://github.com/microsoft/ApplicationInsights-dotnet/blob/main/BreakingChanges.md#metric-name-and-namespace-conventions","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/testfx/issues/comments/4282897711/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/testfx/issues/comments/4298360626","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/testfx/issues/7465#issuecomment-4298360626","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/testfx/issues/7465","id":4298360626,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA-ENlc8AAAABADPHMg","user":{"login":"baronfel","id":573979,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3Mzk3OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/573979?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/baronfel","html_url":"https://github.com/baronfel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baronfel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baronfel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baronfel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baronfel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baronfel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baronfel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baronfel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baronfel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/baronfel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-22T17:08:49Z","updated_at":"2026-04-22T17:09:30Z","body":"SDK in .NET 11 onwards will use opentelemetry for all telemetry tracking - we'll use the Azure Monitor exporter to send our telemetry to AppInsights instead of the AppInsights SDK directly. We merged this a few weeks back!\n\nAs part of this work, the OpenTelemetry libraries were added to source-build, so if you have source-build constraints you can now use all of the api surface + the OTLP exporter.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/testfx/issues/comments/4298360626/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/testfx/issues/comments/4302420545","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/testfx/issues/7465#issuecomment-4302420545","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/testfx/issues/7465","id":4302420545,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA-ENlc8AAAABAHG6QQ","user":{"login":"Evangelink","id":11340282,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzQwMjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11340282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Evangelink","html_url":"https://github.com/Evangelink","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Evangelink/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Evangelink/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Evangelink/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Evangelink/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Evangelink/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Evangelink/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Evangelink/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Evangelink/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Evangelink/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2026-04-23T07:14:47Z","updated_at":"2026-04-23T07:14:47Z","body":"This won't work for VS 2022, right? Do we know which verison of 2026 will support that? I guess until we have to support VS and old NET SDK we will have to stick with AppInsights.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/testfx/issues/comments/4302420545/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]